<section class="page-shell"><div class="page-header"><div><div class="eyebrow">Checkout</div><h1>Konfirmasi pembelian</h1><p>Nominal final ditampilkan sebelum pembayaran.</p></div></div><div class="checkout-layout"><div class="stack-list"><% preview.items.forEach(i=>{ %><div class="list-card"><div><strong><%= i.name %></strong><span><%= i.quantity %> × <%= formatIDR(i.price) %></span></div><b><%= formatIDR(i.lineTotal) %></b></div><% }) %></div><aside class="summary-card"><div class="summary-row"><span>Subtotal</span><b><%= preview.total %></b></div><div class="summary-row"><span>Metode</span><select id="payment-method"><option value="BALANCE">Saldo Wallet</option><option value="GATEWAY">Payment Gateway</option></select></div><hr><div class="summary-row total"><span>Total</span><strong><%= preview.total %></strong></div><button class="button button-primary button-block" data-checkout-confirm><%- icon('check') %> Konfirmasi & Bayar</button><p class="muted small">Status gateway tidak ditentukan oleh browser. Sistem menunggu verifikasi server/webhook.</p></aside></div></section>
